---
source: tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Convert article shape between directory and single-file

Usage: mf article convert [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --root <PATH>        Mind Repo root directory
      --to-single-file     Convert directory articles to single-file articles
      --config <PATH>      Config file path
      --to-directory       Convert single-file articles to directory articles
      --merge              Allow `--to-single-file` to merge multi-block directory articles
                           (concatenated in filename order) instead of skipping them
  -v, --verbose...         Verbose output
      --article <ARTICLE>  Convert only this article (selector: bare slug, docs/<slug>,
                           docs/<slug>.md, or exact title). Without it, converts every eligible
                           article in the project (existing batch behaviour, unchanged)
  -q, --quiet              Silence non-error output
  -n, --dry-run            Preview changes without writing
  -o, --output <FORMAT>    Output format [default: text] [possible values: text, json]
      --json               Shorthand for --output json
      --no-color           Disable colored output
  -p, --project <NAME>     Project name for project-scoped operations
  -h, --help               Print help
  -V, --version            Print version
